        "subject": "LU-20376 tests: except recovery-small/170",
        "message": "LU-20376 tests: except recovery-small/170\n\nThe recovery-small.sh test_170 is failing intermittently since it\nlanded.  It looks like this is an issue with the test case and not the\nfix itself, so except the test case rather than reverting the patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=recovery-small\nFixes: f0d3dbe8e1 (\"LU-18154 ptlrpc: don't delay rq_no_delay after IDLE\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I9f68908b9cf951387595ed606165e305e188c2b5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66757\nReviewed-by: Alexander Boyko <alexander.boyko@hpe.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
